  icon: {fileID: 2800000, guid: 1d166c7ce4bb74049832dc24ab02c47a, type: 3}
  title: JuiceBox
  sections:
  - heading: Welcome
    text: JuiceBox is a visual animation system for Unity. Build complex animation
      sequences using a node-based graph editor with no code required.
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: Quick Start Guide
    text: A step-by-step guide is included in the Demo folder covering setup, the
      graph editor, and animation basics.
    linkText: Open the Quick Start Guide
    url: Demo/QuickStartGuide.html
  - heading: Demo Scenes
    text: 'Two demo scenes are included.


      Basic Demo at JuiceBox/Demo/Basic
      Demo.unity shows JuiceBox in action and how the animations are set up.


      Easing
      Graphs in Demo/2 - Easing/ shows the built-in easing functions as animated
      graphs with sliding page transitions.'
    linkText: 
    url: 
  - heading: JuiceBox Pro
    text: This is the free edition of JuiceBox. JuiceBox Pro is the fully featured
      version, with the complete set of effects and tools. If JuiceBox is a good
      fit for your project, consider upgrading.
    linkText: Get JuiceBox Pro on the Asset Store
    url: https://assetstore.unity.com/packages/slug/376202
  - heading: Website
    text: Visit Dust Factory for more tools, updates, and news.
    linkText: dustfactory.net
    url: https://dustfactory.net/
  - heading: Render Pipeline
    text: 'The demo material uses a Standard shader. On URP or HDRP it will render
      incorrectly until it is pointed at the matching shader.


      The button
      below does that for whichever pipeline this project is using. It touches only
      the bundled demo material, never your own, and it is safe to press more than
      once.'
    linkText: 
    url: 
  highlightOnImport: 0
